	(text "Ribbon headers: JT1 -> tile 1 J_IN (I/Q on SIG0/SIG1, power, shared I2C, S/H clock, sync); tile 1 J_OUT -> tile 2 J_IN -> tile 3 J_OUT -> JADC (8 signals).  One shared I2C bus; each tile has its own TCA9548A (ID jumpers)."
